@startuml
title SEQ-03 - Chrome Context Capture, Preview and Idempotent Save
autonumber
actor User
boundary Page
boundary Content as "Content Script"
control Worker as "Extension Service Worker"
control Core
control GotIt
participant Provider as "Translation / AI"
database DB as "product_gotit"

User -> Page: Select/double-click text
Page -> Content: Selection event
Content -> Content: Extract bounded sentence/title/URL/language hint
Content -> Worker: Validated capture context message
Worker -> Worker: Validate message shape and feature settings
Worker -> Core: Refresh if access token is missing/expiring
Worker -> GotIt: POST /captures/preview\nBearer + bounded context
GotIt -> Core: /auth/me
note over GotIt
Explicit dictionary preview is available to authenticated free users.
Other methods retain vocabulary.write; explicit AI retains paid/add-on checks.
end note
GotIt -> DB: Load profile and existing senses
GotIt -> Provider: Translate/enrich untrusted bounded data
Provider --> GotIt: Candidate meanings
GotIt -> GotIt: Validate/normalize output
GotIt -> DB: Store bounded enrichment trace
GotIt -> GotIt: Sign candidate selection tokens
GotIt --> Worker: Preview + candidates + existing senses
Worker --> Content: Inline preview (no tokens)
Content --> User: Show meanings and sense choices
User -> Content: Choose candidate + merge/new sense
Content -> Worker: INLINE_SAVE(captureId,candidateIndex)
Worker -> Worker: Reconstruct server-validated payload\nReuse stable event UUID
Worker -> GotIt: POST /captures\nIdempotency-Key + payload
GotIt -> Core: Check vocabulary.write entitlement before save
critical Atomic save
  GotIt -> DB: Advisory lock by user+event
  alt Existing receipt, same hash
    DB --> GotIt: Stored receipt
  else Existing key, different hash
    GotIt --> Worker: 409 IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT
  else New event
    GotIt -> GotIt: Verify signed selection and sense decision
    GotIt -> DB: Lock lexical scope
    GotIt -> DB: Create/merge item + translations + occurrence + skills + receipt
  end
end
GotIt --> Worker: Created/merged capture receipt
Worker --> Content: Saved state + practice invitation
Content --> User: Confirmation
note over Content,Worker
Content script never receives access/refresh/provider tokens.
Retry is safe only with the same event UUID and payload.
end note
@enduml

